'''Gold Silver Strike''' (キンギンパワー, ''Kin Gin Pawā'', '''Gold Silver Power''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]].

==Effect==
"Immune to Surge": [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]] gain [[Immune to Surge|Surge Immunity]].

==Requirement==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Gold Silver Strike|"Immune to Surge" Effects Activated|Barista Cat|Commander Cat (13th)|jpname=キンギンパワー|restriction=[[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]] only}}
}}

==Trivia==
*Gold Silver Strike is the only [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Ranger]] [[Cat Combo|Combo]] to require multiple units.

